Goal:
Generate accepted semantic baseline.

Inputs:
- latest versioned repo-understanding artifact
- latest versioned knowledge-confidence artifact
- docs/semantic/review/architect-feedback.md

Outputs must follow:
- docs/semantic/schemas/purpose.schema.md
- docs/semantic/schemas/domains.schema.md
- docs/semantic/schemas/concepts.schema.md
- docs/semantic/schemas/pipelines.schema.md

Rules:
- only run after architect acceptance
- domains must remain lightweight
- baseline must reflect architect-approved understanding
